  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Giuseppe De’Longhi is an Italian industrialist who transformed his family’s Treviso workshop into a global appliance group. He moved the company beyond heating equipment into portable air conditioning, food preparation and coffee machines, led its stock-market listing and served as long-time chairman. Family ownership now continues under his son Fabio’s executive leadership.",
